---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Services | CSR Strategy, Implementation & Reporting | Causewave"
  description="End-to-end CSR support across strategy, program design, field implementation, monitoring, reporting, and stakeholder communication. Practical expertise backed by 18+ years of public health leadership."
  ogTitle="CSR Services | Causewave Innovations LLP"
  ogDescription="We support the full CSR lifecycle — from strategy to impact reporting — with practical, field-tested expertise."
  canonicalPath="/services"
  activePage="services"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Our Services</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">End-to-end CSR support — from strategy to impact reporting.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Services Grid -->
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-sky-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake text-3xl text-sky-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">CSR Strategy & Compliance</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Shape CSR priorities, annual action plans, partner alignment, and reporting readiness around clear statutory and board expectations.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> CSR policy & governance framework</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Annual CSR action plan</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Board & committee advisory</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Regulatory compliance audit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap text-3xl text-teal-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Program Design & Budgeting</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Design practical CSR initiatives across health, education, livelihoods, sustainability, and community development with measurable outputs.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Needs assessment & baseline studies</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Theory of change development</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Budget planning & optimization</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Partner selection & due diligence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-people-carry-box text-3xl text-emerald-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Field Implementation</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">On-ground program execution with community mobilization, training, and last-mile delivery backed by real field experience.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Community engagement & mobilization</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Workforce training & capacity building</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Logistics & supply chain support</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Real-time field coordination</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-sky-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart text-3xl text-sky-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Monitoring & Evaluation</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Rigorous M&E frameworks that track outcomes, surface insights, and enable data-driven course correction throughout the program lifecycle.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Indicator design & frameworks</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Field data collection systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Periodic progress dashboards</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-sky-600 mt-1"></i> Outcome attribution analysis</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-3xl text-teal-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Impact Reporting</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Board-ready, regulator-compliant impact reports that tell a credible story backed by field data and rigorous analysis.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Annual CSR report preparation</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Visual impact dashboards</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Stakeholder-specific narratives</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-teal-600 mt-1"></i> Third-party audit support</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-3xl text-emerald-600"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Stakeholder Communication</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Compelling storytelling and stakeholder engagement that builds trust, showcases impact, and strengthens brand reputation.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> CSR storytelling & content</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Community feedback mechanisms</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Media & PR coordination</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 mt-1"></i> Government & NGO liaison</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-20">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-sky-600 font-semibold">HOW WE WORK</span>
        <h2 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-4">Our engagement process</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4">1</div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Discover</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Understand your CSR mandate, organizational context, and community landscape.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4">2</div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Design</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Develop a practical strategy with clear goals, budgets, and measurable indicators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4">3</div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Deliver</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Execute programs on the ground with rigorous monitoring and real-time adjustments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-sky-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4">4</div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Demonstrate</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600">Produce credible impact reports that satisfy boards, regulators, and communities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">Ready to strengthen your CSR program?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Let's discuss which services are the right fit for your organization's goals and compliance requirements.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 bg-white text-slate-900 rounded-3xl font-semibold">Talk to Our Team</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
